=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">くさ.い・-くさ.い・にお.う・にお.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">臭い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くさい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">臭的；有臭味的；可疑的；蹊跷的；浮夸的；做作的；俗气的；笨拙的；不熟练的；（过于）腥膻的；味道浓烈的；带有……气味的；看起来像；显得像；有……气息的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">面倒臭い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">めんどうくさい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">麻烦；烦人；令人厌烦</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">生臭い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">なまぐさい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">腥味的；血腥的；堕落的（指僧侣）；腐败的；败德的；世俗的；凡俗的；平凡的；可疑的；蹊跷的；靠不住的</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">悦</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>喜悦；欢喜；使喜悦</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">エツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">よろこ.ぶ・よろこ.ばす</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">刃</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>刃；刀剑；锋刃</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジン・ニン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">は・やいば・き.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">刃</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">は</span><span class=\"k-wz\">刀刃；刀锋；（电插头的）插脚；插针</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">縛</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>捆绑；束缚；逮捕；约束</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">バク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读<